pr2301 + pr2302 (owner/peer-merged 2026-09-28: #2302 -> e7aed8db7 at 14:26:38Z, #2301 -> 815478760 right after).
NO snapshot_sidecars.sh .pre was taken before either merge, so record_deploy_attempt.sh cannot bind these
attempts: it selects the run with run_started_at >= dispatched_at, and both runs had started (14:26Z) before
any snapshot could be written. A snapshot written afterwards would carry a false dispatched_at, so none was
written; this note is the record (same shape as pr2272.note).
